PROBLEM 2: npm install fails with EPERM errors
====================================================
ERROR:
  EPERM: operation not permitted, rmdir node_modules\rxjs\...

CAUSE:
  Windows Defender scanning the Downloads folder aggressively.

FIX - Move project out of Downloads:
  mkdir C:\projects\han12
  Copy-Item C:\Users\Home\Downloads\han12zip\* C:\projects\han12\ -Exclude node_modules -Recurse
  cd C:\projects\han12
  npm install --ignore-scripts

  !! ALWAYS work from C:\projects\han12, NEVER from Downloads !!

If node_modules won't delete, use robocopy trick:
  mkdir C:\empty_temp
  robocopy C:\empty_temp C:\projects\han12\node_modules /MIR
  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force C:\projects\han12\node_modules
  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force C:\empty_temp


