PROBLEM 3: npm install fails with ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE
====================================================
ERROR:
  The "file" argument must be of type string. Received undefined

CAUSE:
  esbuild's postinstall script fails on some Windows setups.

FIX:
  npm install --ignore-scripts
  node node_modules/esbuild/install.js

  If that still fails:
  npm install --ignore-scripts
  npm install @esbuild/win32-x64 --save-dev


