====================================================
PROBLEM 5: npm run dev exits immediately / does nothing
====================================================
CAUSE:
  Windows blocks the "start" command when called through npm scripts
  due to quote escaping issues with concurrently.

FIX - Use dev.bat directly instead:
  .\dev.bat

  This opens two separate windows:
  - Window 1: esbuild watching src/main.ts -> public/js/app.js
  - Window 2: nodemon watching server.ts, restarts on changes

dev.bat contents (located at C:\Projects\han12\dev.bat):
  @echo off
  start "esbuild" cmd /k "npx esbuild src/main.ts --bundle --outfile=public/js/app.js --platform=browser --watch"
  start "nodemon" cmd /k "npx nodemon --exec ts-node server.ts --watch server.ts"


